  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "tone": "intro",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/00.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "dur": 50.075,
      "speech_start": 3.34,
      "speech_end": 48.76,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Welcome to Truthward.",
          "start": 3.34,
          "dur": 1.65,
          "abs_start": 3.34
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Quick version of what we do here, because your time matters.",
          "start": 4.99,
          "dur": 3.99,
          "abs_start": 4.99
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Most channels hand you an answer and a reason to be angry about it.",
          "start": 8.98,
          "dur": 5.33,
          "abs_start": 8.98
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "We do the opposite.",
          "start": 14.31,
          "dur": 1.833,
          "abs_start": 14.31
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "We take one big question, the kind you are not really supposed to poke at, and we just look at it.",
          "start": 16.143,
          "dur": 7.198,
          "abs_start": 16.143
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Honestly.",
          "start": 23.341,
          "dur": 1.036,
          "abs_start": 23.341
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Slowly.",
          "start": 24.377,
          "dur": 0.543,
          "abs_start": 24.377
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Out loud.",
          "start": 24.92,
          "dur": 0.997,
          "abs_start": 24.92
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "No shouting, no agenda, and no, I am not going to tell you what to think.",
          "start": 25.917,
          "dur": 5.764,
          "abs_start": 25.917
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "Mostly because you would not listen anyway, and honestly, fair enough.",
          "start": 31.681,
          "dur": 5.329,
          "abs_start": 31.681
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "If that sounds like your kind of trouble, subscribe before we start.",
          "start": 37.01,
          "dur": 4.74,
          "abs_start": 37.01
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "Now.",
          "start": 41.75,
          "dur": 0.157,
          "abs_start": 41.75
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "Let us begin with something slightly embarrassing about the human brain.",
          "start": 41.907,
          "dur": 5.233,
          "abs_start": 41.907
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "Yours included.",
          "start": 47.14,
          "dur": 1.62,
          "abs_start": 47.14
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 3.34,
          "dur": 45.42,
          "label": "intro (merk)",
          "img": "",
          "vid": ""
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "tone": "hook",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/01.wav",
      "start": 50.075,
      "dur": 37.125,
      "speech_start": 0.36,
      "speech_end": 36,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "There is one thing you would never let a stranger do to you.",
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 4.283,
          "abs_start": 50.435
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Operate on you without first checking who they are.",
          "start": 4.643,
          "dur": 3.745,
          "abs_start": 54.718
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "You will read the reviews on a ten euro phone case before you buy it.",
          "start": 8.388,
          "dur": 4.852,
          "abs_start": 58.463
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "But the biggest question you will ever face, the one about why you are even here, most people answered without looking into it even once.",
          "start": 13.24,
          "dur": 10.503,
          "abs_start": 63.315
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "And they will defend that answer to their last breath.",
          "start": 23.743,
          "dur": 3.475,
          "abs_start": 73.818
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Does that strike you as strange?",
          "start": 27.218,
          "dur": 1.952,
          "abs_start": 77.293
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "It should.",
          "start": 29.17,
          "dur": 0.88,
          "abs_start": 79.245
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "So let us do the one thing almost nobody does with it.",
          "start": 30.05,
          "dur": 4.091,
          "abs_start": 80.125
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "Let us actually look.",
          "start": 34.141,
          "dur": 1.859,
          "abs_start": 84.216
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 8.028,
          "label": "de chirurg / geen vreemde opereert",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s01b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 8.388,
          "dur": 18.83,
          "label": "de reviews → de grootste vraag",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s01b2.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 27.218,
          "dur": 8.782,
          "label": "dus: laten we kijken",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s01b3.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": [
        {
          "t": 36,
          "name": "end",
          "file": "assets/channels/channel1/sfx/s01_end.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/02.wav",
      "start": 87.2,
      "dur": 41.325,
      "speech_start": 0.32,
      "speech_end": 40.22,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Start with what you are.",
          "start": 0.32,
          "dur": 1.45,
          "abs_start": 87.52
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "A bird does not decide to fly south.",
          "start": 1.77,
          "dur": 2.93,
          "abs_start": 88.97
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "It is born with the answer already inside it, where to go, what to eat, what to run from.",
          "start": 4.7,
          "dur": 6.41,
          "abs_start": 91.9
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "It runs its program and never once asks a question.",
          "start": 11.11,
          "dur": 3.51,
          "abs_start": 98.31
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "You are not built like that.",
          "start": 14.62,
          "dur": 1.936,
          "abs_start": 101.82
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "You wake up in front of choices nothing prepared you for, and you have to work them out yourself.",
          "start": 16.556,
          "dur": 6.824,
          "abs_start": 103.756
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "You weigh things.",
          "start": 23.38,
          "dur": 0.838,
          "abs_start": 110.58
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "You reason.",
          "start": 24.218,
          "dur": 1.017,
          "abs_start": 111.418
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "You decide.",
          "start": 25.235,
          "dur": 1.016,
          "abs_start": 112.435
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "A dog is a wonderful thing.",
          "start": 26.251,
          "dur": 2.32,
          "abs_start": 113.451
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "A dog is also never going to lie awake at night wondering why it is a dog.",
          "start": 28.571,
          "dur": 5.968,
          "abs_start": 115.771
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "No other creature on this earth does that.",
          "start": 34.539,
          "dur": 2.84,
          "abs_start": 121.739
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "It is the one thing that is truly yours.",
          "start": 37.379,
          "dur": 2.841,
          "abs_start": 124.579
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.32,
          "dur": 14.3,
          "label": "de vogel: ingebouwd programma",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s02b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.62,
          "dur": 11.631,
          "label": "jij weegt, redeneert, kiest",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s02b2.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 26.251,
          "dur": 13.969,
          "label": "de hond vraagt nooit waarom",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s02b3.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/03.wav",
      "start": 128.525,
      "dur": 23.275,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 22.12,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And you do it so often you do not even notice.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 4.077,
          "abs_start": 128.865
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "You glance at the sky and grab a jacket.",
          "start": 4.417,
          "dur": 2.982,
          "abs_start": 132.942
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "A tiny moment.",
          "start": 7.399,
          "dur": 1.371,
          "abs_start": 135.924
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "But that tiny moment is the whole thing.",
          "start": 8.77,
          "dur": 3.17,
          "abs_start": 137.295
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "You took in the world, you weighed it, and you made a call.",
          "start": 11.94,
          "dur": 4.36,
          "abs_start": 140.465
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "You do that a thousand times a day without ever once calling it thinking.",
          "start": 16.3,
          "dur": 5.82,
          "abs_start": 144.825
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 7.059,
          "label": "een blik op de lucht, een jas",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s03b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 7.399,
          "dur": 14.721,
          "label": "duizend keuzes per dag",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s03b2.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/04.wav",
      "start": 151.8,
      "dur": 42.35,
      "speech_start": 0.36,
      "speech_end": 41.02,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And when it gets serious, you do something even smarter.",
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 4.718,
          "abs_start": 152.16
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "A pain shows up and will not leave.",
          "start": 5.078,
          "dur": 2.545,
          "abs_start": 156.878
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "You do not start cutting into yourself in the kitchen with a bread knife and a confident YouTube tutorial.",
          "start": 7.623,
          "dur": 8.107,
          "abs_start": 159.423
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "You stop, and you think, I do not know enough about this, so I will go to someone who does.",
          "start": 15.73,
          "dur": 7.49,
          "abs_start": 167.53
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Look at what that is.",
          "start": 23.22,
          "dur": 1.702,
          "abs_start": 175.02
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "You saw the edge of your own knowledge, and you walked toward the person who could fill the gap.",
          "start": 24.922,
          "dur": 6.988,
          "abs_start": 176.722
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "That is not weakness.",
          "start": 31.91,
          "dur": 1.704,
          "abs_start": 183.71
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Seeing your own limit and acting on it is about the most rational thing a human being can do.",
          "start": 33.614,
          "dur": 7.406,
          "abs_start": 185.414
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 7.263,
          "label": "de pijn die niet weggaat",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s04b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 7.623,
          "dur": 17.299,
