        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/06.wav",
      "start": 229.275,
      "dur": 34.4,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 32.98,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Except on one question.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 1.91,
          "abs_start": 229.615
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "There is exactly one place where most people switch that whole machine off.",
          "start": 2.25,
          "dur": 4.295,
          "abs_start": 231.525
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "And it is not a small one.",
          "start": 6.545,
          "dur": 2.059,
          "abs_start": 235.82
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "It is the biggest there is.",
          "start": 8.604,
          "dur": 2.06,
          "abs_start": 237.879
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Bigger than your health, bigger than your money, bigger than any case in any court.",
          "start": 10.664,
          "dur": 6.116,
          "abs_start": 239.939
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Why are you here.",
          "start": 16.78,
          "dur": 1.06,
          "abs_start": 246.055
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "What is this.",
          "start": 17.84,
          "dur": 1.05,
          "abs_start": 247.115
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "What happens when it ends.",
          "start": 18.89,
          "dur": 1.889,
          "abs_start": 248.165
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "On that one, most people never find out first.",
          "start": 20.779,
          "dur": 2.931,
          "abs_start": 250.054
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "They just have an answer.",
          "start": 23.71,
          "dur": 1.72,
          "abs_start": 252.985
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "They carry it their whole life.",
          "start": 25.43,
          "dur": 2.27,
          "abs_start": 254.705
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "And if you ask them when they actually looked into it, the room goes quiet.",
          "start": 27.7,
          "dur": 5.28,
          "abs_start": 256.975
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 10.324,
          "label": "op één vraag gaat het licht uit",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s06b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 10.664,
          "dur": 10.115,
          "label": "groter dan alles: waarom ben je hier",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s06b2.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 20.779,
          "dur": 12.201,
          "label": "ze hebben gewoon een antwoord",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s06b3.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/07.wav",
      "start": 263.675,
      "dur": 35.85,
      "speech_start": 0.36,
      "speech_end": 34.22,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And I am not standing above anyone here.",
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 2.94,
          "abs_start": 264.035
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "I am telling you this because it was me.",
          "start": 3.3,
          "dur": 3.43,
          "abs_start": 266.975
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "I had my answer too.",
          "start": 6.73,
          "dur": 1.75,
          "abs_start": 270.405
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "I carried it like it was mine, like I had earned it.",
          "start": 8.48,
          "dur": 4.246,
          "abs_start": 272.155
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Until one day I asked myself a simple thing.",
          "start": 12.726,
          "dur": 3.174,
          "abs_start": 276.401
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "When did I ever sit down with the biggest question there is, and do what I would do for a crack in a wall, find out before I trust it?",
          "start": 15.9,
          "dur": 9.71,
          "abs_start": 279.575
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And the honest answer was never.",
          "start": 25.61,
          "dur": 2.82,
          "abs_start": 289.285
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Not once.",
          "start": 28.43,
          "dur": 0.86,
          "abs_start": 292.105
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "It had been handed to me, and I had spent years calling it my own.",
          "start": 29.29,
          "dur": 4.93,
          "abs_start": 292.965
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 12.366,
          "label": "ik had mijn antwoord ook",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s07b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 12.726,
          "dur": 21.494,
          "label": "de barst in de muur: nooit onderzocht",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s07b2.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/08.wav",
      "start": 299.525,
      "dur": 63.75,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 62.58,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So I started paying attention to where people actually get this answer, if not from looking into it.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 7.533,
          "abs_start": 299.865
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "And as far as I can tell, it comes in through about five doors.",
          "start": 7.873,
          "dur": 4.527,
          "abs_start": 307.398
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "The first is home.",
          "start": 12.4,
          "dur": 1.85,
          "abs_start": 311.925
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "Your parents believed something, or believed in nothing, and it was yours before you could even speak.",
          "start": 14.25,
          "dur": 7.732,
          "abs_start": 313.775
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "The second is a single moment.",
          "start": 21.982,
          "dur": 2.438,
          "abs_start": 321.507
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Something happened you could not explain, and you took it as proof, and never went back to it.",
          "start": 24.42,
          "dur": 7.15,
          "abs_start": 323.945
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "The third is the people around you.",
          "start": 31.57,
          "dur": 2.438,
          "abs_start": 331.095
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Everyone leaned one way, and leaning with them was easier than standing alone.",
          "start": 34.008,
          "dur": 5.889,
          "abs_start": 333.533
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "The fourth is the world itself.",
          "start": 39.897,
          "dur": 2.503,
          "abs_start": 339.422
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "The films, the shows, the things school handed you as simply true.",
          "start": 42.4,
          "dur": 4.23,
          "abs_start": 341.925
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "A thousand small pushes you never once felt as pushes.",
          "start": 46.63,
          "dur": 3.73,
          "abs_start": 346.155
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "And the fifth is pain.",
          "start": 50.36,
          "dur": 1.69,
          "abs_start": 349.885
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "Someone hurt you in the name of their answer, so you took the opposite one.",
          "start": 52.05,
          "dur": 5.6,
          "abs_start": 351.575
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "Not because you weighed it, but because you were running from them.",
          "start": 57.65,
          "dur": 4.93,
          "abs_start": 357.175
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 12.06,
          "label": "deur 1: thuis / je ouders",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s08b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 12.4,
          "dur": 9.582,
          "label": "deur 2: één moment",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s08b2.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 21.982,
          "dur": 9.588,
          "label": "deur 3: de mensen om je heen",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s08b3.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 31.57,
          "dur": 18.79,
          "label": "deur 4: de wereld / de schermen",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s08b4.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 50.36,
          "dur": 12.22,
          "label": "deur 5: de pijn",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s08b5.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/09.wav",
      "start": 363.275,
      "dur": 29.55,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 28.1,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Now look at those five.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 1.78,
          "abs_start": 363.615
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Four of them are something arriving from outside you.",
          "start": 2.12,
          "dur": 4.124,
          "abs_start": 365.395
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "One is you pushing something away.",
          "start": 6.244,
          "dur": 3.094,
          "abs_start": 369.519
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And not one of them is you sitting down and reasoning it out.",
          "start": 9.338,
          "dur": 4.852,
          "abs_start": 372.613
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Yet for most people, this is how they came to hold the most important thing they believe.",
          "start": 14.19,
          "dur": 6.048,
          "abs_start": 377.465
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "One swallowed it whole.",
          "start": 20.238,
          "dur": 1.958,
          "abs_start": 383.513
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "The next spat it out just as fast.",
          "start": 22.196,
          "dur": 2.864,
          "abs_start": 385.471
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And both of them were certain they had chosen.",
          "start": 25.06,
          "dur": 3.04,
          "abs_start": 388.335
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 8.998,
          "label": "vijf deuren: vier van buiten, één duwt weg",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s09b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 9.338,
          "dur": 18.762,
          "label": "en beiden zeker dat ze kozen",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s09b2.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": [
        {
          "t": 28.1,
          "name": "end",
          "file": "assets/channels/channel1/sfx/s09_end.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/10.wav",
      "start": 392.825,
      "dur": 58.925,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 57.56,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And here is the part that is harder to shake.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 3.344,
          "abs_start": 393.165
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "You might be thinking, fine, I was a child, I did not pick it back then.",
          "start": 3.684,
          "dur": 5.537,
          "abs_start": 396.509
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "But I am grown now.",
          "start": 9.221,
          "dur": 1.658,
          "abs_start": 402.046
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "If it were wrong, I would have gone back to check.",
          "start": 10.879,
          "dur": 3.513,
          "abs_start": 403.704
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Most of us never do.",
          "start": 14.392,
          "dur": 2.058,
          "abs_start": 407.217
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "And it is not because we are not clever enough.",
          "start": 16.45,
          "dur": 3.788,
          "abs_start": 409.275
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "It is that by now the answer is not just something you think.",
          "start": 20.238,
          "dur": 4.802,
          "abs_start": 413.063
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "It is part of who you are.",
          "start": 25.04,
          "dur": 2.168,
          "abs_start": 417.865
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "It is woven into the people you belong to.",
          "start": 27.208,
          "dur": 3.762,
          "abs_start": 420.033
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "And when something sits that close, you do not test it.",
          "start": 30.97,
          "dur": 3.938,
          "abs_start": 423.795
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "You protect it.",
          "start": 34.908,
          "dur": 1.682,
          "abs_start": 427.733
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "You take that same sharp mind that picks the right doctor, and you point it at defending your answer instead of examining it.",
          "start": 36.59,
          "dur": 8.829,
          "abs_start": 429.415
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "That is the strange part.",
          "start": 45.419,
          "dur": 1.401,
          "abs_start": 438.244
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "The sharper the mind, the better it gets at the defending.",
          "start": 46.82,
          "dur": 4.67,
          "abs_start": 439.645
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "It is not the careless who are most stuck here.",
          "start": 51.49,
          "dur": 3.68,
          "abs_start": 444.315
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "Often it is the brightest.",
          "start": 55.17,
          "dur": 2.39,
          "abs_start": 447.995
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 14.052,
          "label": "'ik ben nu volwassen' (spiegel)",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s10b1.mp4"
