    {
      "scene": 11,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/11.wav",
      "start": 451.75,
      "dur": 65.55,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 64.08,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 0.541,
          "abs_start": 452.09
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Why does the thinking creature not think, right here, on the one question that matters most?",
          "start": 0.881,
          "dur": 6.349,
          "abs_start": 452.631
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "That is the question I promised to answer, so here it is, plainly.",
          "start": 7.23,
          "dur": 5.82,
          "abs_start": 458.98
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "Not because people are stupid.",
          "start": 13.05,
          "dur": 2.1,
          "abs_start": 464.8
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Because an answer was already waiting.",
          "start": 15.15,
          "dur": 3.16,
          "abs_start": 466.9
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Through one of those five doors, there was always something filled in before you arrived.",
          "start": 18.31,
          "dur": 6.57,
          "abs_start": 470.06
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "There was never a blank page in front of you asking to be filled.",
          "start": 24.88,
          "dur": 5.47,
          "abs_start": 476.63
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And the one time you might have gone back to check, the answer had already become part of you, so you guarded it instead.",
          "start": 30.35,
          "dur": 9.088,
          "abs_start": 482.1
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "That is the answer.",
          "start": 39.438,
          "dur": 1.679,
          "abs_start": 491.188
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "And I will be honest about my own.",
          "start": 41.117,
          "dur": 3.423,
          "abs_start": 492.867
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "These are the five doors I could find.",
          "start": 44.54,
          "dur": 2.2,
          "abs_start": 496.29
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "Maybe there is a sixth.",
          "start": 46.74,
          "dur": 1.76,
          "abs_start": 498.49
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "They are not fixed in stone just because they came out of my head, that is the whole point of this.",
          "start": 48.5,
          "dur": 6.901,
          "abs_start": 500.25
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "But look at them honestly, and ask yourself whether even one of them is a reason to be sure of anything.",
          "start": 55.401,
          "dur": 8.679,
          "abs_start": 507.151
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 14.81,
          "label": "waarom denkt het denkende wezen niet?",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s11b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.15,
          "dur": 25.967,
          "label": "er lag al een antwoord klaar",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s11b2.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 41.117,
          "dur": 22.963,
          "label": "misschien een zesde deur",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s11b3.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/12.wav",
      "start": 517.3,
      "dur": 72.05,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 70.56,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And this is where it starts to itch.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 2.56,
          "abs_start": 517.64
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "If your answer to the biggest question did not come from you, but from where you happened to be born, and who raised you, and what hurt you, then how would you ever know if it is true?",
          "start": 2.9,
          "dur": 13.45,
          "abs_start": 520.2
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Most people never reach that question.",
          "start": 16.35,
          "dur": 2.2,
          "abs_start": 533.65
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "But most is not all.",
          "start": 18.55,
          "dur": 1.563,
          "abs_start": 535.85
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Some do go back.",
          "start": 20.113,
          "dur": 1.345,
          "abs_start": 537.413
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Some do sit down with it.",
          "start": 21.458,
          "dur": 1.662,
          "abs_start": 538.758
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "That is the only reason anyone has ever changed their mind about anything.",
          "start": 23.12,
          "dur": 6.247,
          "abs_start": 540.42
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "So maybe you are one who looks, this time.",
          "start": 29.367,
          "dur": 2.863,
          "abs_start": 546.667
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "And the moment you try, something stands in the doorway.",
          "start": 32.23,
          "dur": 4.08,
          "abs_start": 549.53
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "A voice that says, who cares, it is all just opinion anyway.",
          "start": 36.31,
          "dur": 5.56,
          "abs_start": 553.61
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "Your truth, my truth, nobody is really right.",
          "start": 41.87,
          "dur": 3.48,
          "abs_start": 559.17
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "And if that is true, this whole thing is pointless.",
          "start": 45.35,
          "dur": 3.433,
          "abs_start": 562.65
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "So before we go anywhere near what the answer might be, we have to deal with that one first.",
          "start": 48.783,
          "dur": 6.567,
          "abs_start": 566.083
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "Is there even such a thing as a truth that stays true, whether you believe it or not.",
          "start": 55.35,
          "dur": 6.16,
          "abs_start": 572.65
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "Or is all of it just opinion.",
          "start": 61.51,
          "dur": 3.05,
          "abs_start": 578.81
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "Until we settle that, nothing else has any ground to stand on.",
          "start": 64.56,
          "dur": 4.51,
          "abs_start": 581.86
        },
        {
          "i": 16,
          "text": "That is the next one.",
          "start": 69.07,
          "dur": 1.49,
          "abs_start": 586.37
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 16.01,
          "label": "hoe weet je of het waar is?",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s12b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 16.35,
          "dur": 15.88,
